goldenland-realestate-v2 (project) — AI Assist workflow + architecture/test quirks:
• Workflow (USER PREFERENCE — missing it gets called out): per implement-skill ticket, load the originating issue via gh and read the 'Parent' section + acceptance criteria. Two-axis code review (standards + spec) via parallel sub-agents is mandatory before commit; write the review ledger to docs/agents/reviews/<issue-number>.md. Never skip the Resolve step: `gh issue close` with summary (commit SHA, test results, ledger path), appending pointer to #1's 'Implementation Decisions'. The code-review skill requires an explicit fixed point (commit SHA/tag/branch/range) to review against — prompt for it if not given; for ranges use `git diff <fixed-point>...HEAD` plus `git log <fixed-point>..HEAD`. <!-- created=2026-08-08, last=2026-08-08 -->
