Code-review flow for goldenland-realestate-v2: when the skill asks for a fixed point to review against, if the user doesn't supply one, pin it per-ticket from the commit graph (find feature commit and its parent) — the parent SHA is the fixed point for that ticket's diff. For close-out of multiple tickets, batch the per-ticket reviews (2 axes × N tickets) as parallel sub-agents. Ledgers are written under docs/agents/reviews/<issue>.md with fixed point, spec source, standards sources, and a findings table (finding / axis / classification / disposition). <!-- created=2026-08-08, last=2026-08-08 -->
