When reviews run in parallel sub-agents via the pi-subagents extension, the aggregate return may be truncated and individual children can fail with transient provider errors (e.g. 'Model is unavailable'). Always inspect the raw child outputs from the artifacts (.pi-subagents/artifacts/) and re-run any failed child rather than trusting the workflow completion event. <!-- created=2026-08-08, last=2026-08-08 -->
